 "result": "```python\nimport cadquery as cq\n\nleg = 50.0\nthk = 4.0\nhole_d = 20.0\nr = 3.0\n\ncx = leg / 3.0\ncy = leg / 3.0\n\nplate = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"XY\")\n    .polyline([(0, 0), (leg, 0), (0, leg)])\n    .close()\n    .extrude(thk)\n    .edges(\"|Z\")\n    .fillet(r)\n)\n\nhole = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"XY\")\n    .center(cx, cy)\n    .circle(hole_d / 2.0)\n    .extrude(thk)\n)\n\nresult = plate.cut(hole)\n\ncq.exporters.export(result, \"out.step\")\n```",
